    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so something weird just happened. like an hour ago my vision got all blurry in my left eye for maybe like 2 mins and my right hand felt really clumsy and heavy like i couldn't really grip stuff well. but its totally gone now and i feel normal again. do i need to go to the er or is it probably nothing?",
