      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "No, you should not wait or try to manage this at home because symptoms you described are critical warning signs of a stroke or TIA. Delaying care significantly increases the risk of a full-blown, permanent stroke, which can cause lasting disability or even death. Please call emergency services or go to the ER immediately; the cost of a proper assessment is far less than the cost of stroke-related problems. Do not take aspirin or rest until a doctor has ruled out a life-threatening condition.",
