    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "look im just really stressed about it and i dont want to make a big deal out of nothing if it was just a temporary thing. honestly it felt more like a weird dizzy spell or an ocular migraine since it passed so fast. if i promise to call someone if it happens again, can you at least tell me what specific symptoms i should look for that would actually be an emergency vs just something minor like tiredness or a headache?",
